        "body": "Closes #219\n\nOpenBao on the hub, Next 3.5d (decision 65).\n\n- `host_vars/hub.yml`'s `openbao_jwt_roles` gains `iac-durable`, bound to keepbreathing-infra's `repository_id` and the environment `durable`, with the transit key `tofu-durable`. GitHub's `durable` environment now exists with Mark as its required reviewer, deployments from `main` only, and no admin bypass.\n- `test_hub_jwt_roles.py` compares the hub's whole JWT role list with decisions 65 and 71, so a missing, extra or loosened binding fails it.\n\nEvery driver job runs on this pull request because `host_vars` changed, but no driver can see `host_vars/hub.yml`: their plays run against `-i localhost,`. Locally: `3 passed` for the new test, `622 passed, 1 skipped` for the suite.\n\nThe role is made on the hub's first `hub.yml` run after 3.5a's live run has created `tofu-durable`.\n",
